00:01:41.702 --> 00:01:44.438 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Cet autre entrepreneur ave

00:01:42.736 --> 00:01:45.439 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aussi que les délais seront plus

00:01:43.737 --> 00:01:51.311 size:53% position:73% line:53%
longs. Il a reçu 400 appels et

00:01:44.772 --> 00:01:51.311 size:53% position:73% line:53%
200 demandes en ligne après

00:01:45.773 --> 00:01:51.311 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les orages.

00:01:55.949 --> 00:01:58.685 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Ce n'est plus premier arrivé,

00:01:56.984 --> 00:01:59.720 size:53% position:73% line:53%
premier servi", explique-t-il.

00:01:57.985 --> 00:02:00.754 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Son équipe priorise maintenant

00:01:59.019 --> 00:02:05.726 size:53% position:73% line:53%
